838
06:18:12,239 --> 06:18:17,020
het...

839
06:18:17,179 --> 06:18:18,299
nieuwe...

840
06:18:19,080 --> 06:18:21,140
jaar...

841
06:18:21,739 --> 06:18:25,679
onder...

842
06:18:25,940 --> 06:18:27,900
het...

843
06:18:27,960 --> 06:18:28,900
Spaans...

844
06:18:28,960 --> 06:18:30,120
voorzitterschap...

845
06:18:30,159 --> 06:18:34,920
afspraken kunnen maken opdat
we de instroom op Europees...

846
06:18:34,960 --> 06:18:36,179
niveau...

847
06:18:36,520 --> 06:18:37,900
kunnen...

848
06:18:37,960 --> 06:18:39,299
beperken.

849
06:18:39,319 --> 06:18:43,500
De afgelopen periode stonden we hier zo'n
beetje iedere maand bij het vragenuur,

850
06:18:43,839 --> 06:18:47,900
omdat er...

851
06:18:48,319 --> 06:18:49,319
weer...

852
06:18:50,299 --> 06:18:52,679
